WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.619
This code one-hot encodes the nominal variable sex
The goal is

00:00:05.645 --> 00:00:11.470
to represent categories without assigning them a
single numerical rank With

00:00:11.483 --> 00:00:17.436
drop first one category becomes the reference Handle
unknown provides

00:00:17.449 --> 00:00:23.927
a defined behavior if a later dataset contains a
category not seen during fitting The

00:00:23.941 --> 00:00:28.033
key idea is that the encoding follows from the
nominal meaning of the variable
